		<div class="topic" id="forum_op_topic_563671642446830015">
		Non-stop AI SLOP!	</div>
	<div class="content" id="forum_op_content_563671642446830015">
		The &quot;clean up and organize&quot; genre is a cesspool of garbage.	</div>
		
	<div class="forum_op_footer">
		<div></div>
			</div>
</div>
<div data-featuretarget="community-awards"></div>
<script type="text/javascript">
	$J( function() {
		InitializeForumTopic( {"owner":"46500940","type":"General","feature":"0","gidforum":"588439574765634901","forum_display_name":"General Discussions","forum_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/5316540\/discussions\/0\/","forum_search_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/5316540\/discussions\/search\/","is_public":1,"permissions":{"can_view":1,"can_post":1,"can_reply":1,"is_banned":0,"can_delete":0,"can_edit":0},"appid":5316540}, "https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/forum\/46500940\/General\/",
		"563671642446830015", {"author":"Painfully Unmagic","text":"The \"clean up and organize\" genre is a cesspool of garbage."}		);
			} );
</script>
										<script type="text/javascript">
$J( function() { InitializeCommentThread( "ForumTopic", "ForumTopic_103582791476022348_588439574765634901_563671642446830015", {"feature":"588439574765634901","feature2":"563671642446830015","owner":"103582791476022348","commentthreadid":"660857842","total_count":12,"start":0,"pagesize":15,"has_upvoted":0,"upvotes":0,"votecountid":null,"voteupid":null,"commentcountid":null,"subscribed":false,"extended_data":"{\"topic_permissions\":{\"can_view\":1,\"can_post\":1,\"can_reply\":1,\"is_banned\":0,\"can_delete\":0,\"can_edit\":0},\"original_poster\":47928107,\"topic_gidanswer\":\"0\",\"forum_appid\":5316540,\"forum_public\":1,\"forum_type\":\"General\",\"forum_gidfeature\":\"0\"}","oldestfirst":true,"comments_raw":{"563671642446857552":{"text":"And you think bullying developers and players is going to change anything? Believe it or not, there are other people in this world besides you and thousands of us want this genre. I'm sure you're into a lot of things I would think are garbage, but that's your business.","author":"Poof"},"563671642446869546":{"text":"Okay and? You dont like it?, dont buy it or play it. I'd rather play something AI like this then the slop of AAA studios (Cough cough COD)","author":"Frosty"},"563671642446874608":{"text":"WTF difference does it make if they use AI or not? I don't see you creating anything but hate on every game forum that has anything to do with AI? Are you a game designer out of a job, I don't think so, are you an artist in need of work? I don't think so. So keep your nasty remarks about AI to yourself. You and so many other losers have tried to ruin games for all the rest of us because you are living in the 90s, not the 2020s!!","author":"crztrucker57"},"563671642446883740":{"text":"[quote=Poof;563671642446857552]And you think bullying developers and players is going to change anything? Believe it or not, there are other people in this world besides you and thousands of us want this genre. I'm sure you're into a lot of things I would think are garbage, but that's your business. [\/quote]\n\nYes... which is why we do it lol.","author":"EQOAnostalgia"},"563671642446987801":{"text":"Just start reporting these weirdos for targetted harrassment.","author":"Aussiebeast"},"563671642447078887":{"text":"I am just checking the game out for the first time and idk....you guys know the forums are for feedback, right? \n\nAI is a controversial topic and people can voice their opinions, whether you, me, or anyone agrees.","author":"Pugs"},"563671642447085016":{"text":"I'm not interested in the opinions of anti-AI folks. Not sorry about it either. \u02d0tabbycat\u02d0","author":"VenomKisses"},"563671642447089308":{"text":"the game is good, get with the times buddy.","author":"UselessFoetus"},"563671642447092732":{"text":"So much water and human talent wasted. I will fight AI till the day I die. Try having a data center in your backyard; the pollution, NONSTOP HIGH DECIBEL SOUNDS and higher utility costs for the residents. Not to mention, no one actually benefits from the presence of data centers in their communities. \n\nEnjoy your game, folks. Truly.","author":"Megatronica"},"563671928222530648":{"text":"AI isn't the only thing or even the worst thing that uses data centers. Are you willing to give up those other things as well? Go on a crusade about them? Want to go on a crusade against water usage instead? You'll have to go vegan. The animal industry is the BIGGEST water drain on the planet by a lot.\n\nHere\u2019s the relative impact to our environment of common digital activities:\n\nYouTube or Netflix, 1 hour (HD)\n~0.12 kWh \u2192 42 g CO\u2082\nTied for the dirtiest single activity in the study.\n\nText-to-video generation, 6\u201310 seconds\n~0.05 kWh \u2192 17.5 g CO\u2082\nRoughly the same as an hour-long Zoom call.\n\nZoom, 1 hour\n~0.0486 kWh \u2192 17 g CO\u2082\n\nShort email, no attachment\n~0.0133 kWh \u2192 4.7 g CO\u2082\nOne email is tiny, billions per day are not.\n\nAI image generation, 1 image\n~0.003 kWh \u2192 1 g CO\u2082\n\nVoice assistant query (Alexa\/Siri\/etc.)\n~0.0005 kWh \u2192 0.175 g CO\u2082\n\nGoogle search or AI chatbot prompt\n~0.0003 kWh \u2192 0.105 g CO\u2082\n\nTwo Gemini prompts\n~0.00024 kWh \u2192 0.084 g CO\u2082 total (~0.042 per prompt)\n\nMost anti-AI people just don't know what they're talking about. That's why I don't care about their opinions or their judgment.","author":"VenomKisses"},"563671928222557812":{"text":"[quote=VenomKisses;563671642447085016]I'm not interested in the opinions of anti-AI folks. Not sorry about it either. :tabbycat: [\/quote]\n\nWell, you are going to have a hard time over the next few years. The discussions on AI are only going to get more intense as it causes more disturbances in the workforce. \n\nYou can have your opinion, but you certainly can't suppress other people's opinions.","author":"Pugs"},"565923773630430986":{"text":"[quote=Poof;563671642446857552]And you think bullying developers and players is going to change anything? Believe it or not, there are other people in this world besides you and thousands of us want this genre. I'm sure you're into a lot of things I would think are garbage, but that's your business. [\/quote]\ndoes putting a tv dinner in the microwave make you a chef?","author":"evelessence"}},"track_navigation":true}, 'https://steamcommunity.com/comment/ForumTopic/', 40 ); } );
</script>
