			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_563671642447092732">
				So much water and human talent wasted. I will fight AI till the day I die. Try having a data center in your backyard; the pollution, NONSTOP HIGH DECIBEL SOUNDS and higher utility costs for the residents. Not to mention, no one actually benefits from the presence of data centers in their communities. <br><br>Enjoy your game, folks. Truly.			</div>
