				<blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b><a href="#c563671642447085016">VenomKisses</a></b>:</div>I'm not interested in the opinions of anti-AI folks. Not sorry about it either. :tabbycat: </blockquote><br>Well, you are going to have a hard time over the next few years. The discussions on AI are only going to get more intense as it causes more disturbances in the workforce. <br><br>You can have your opinion, but you certainly can't suppress other people's opinions.			</div>
